<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Economy and indicators'}) %><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">ECONOMIC CONTEXT</span><h1>Look at the economy<br><em>from more than one angle.</em></h1><p>Growth matters, but so do household prices, jobs, debt, service delivery and how benefits are distributed.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="row g-3"><% economy.forEach(item=>{ %><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><div class="metric-card large"><span class="metric-period"><%= item.period %></span><strong><%= item.value %></strong><h3><%= item.label %></h3><p><%= item.detail %></p><a href="<%= item.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Verify at source ↗</a></div></div><% }) %></div><div class="section-head mt-5"><div><span class="eyebrow dark">QUESTIONS TO TRACK</span><h2>What the numbers cannot tell you alone</h2></div></div><div class="row g-3"><% [['Cost of living','Track prices of food, rent, transport, energy and school costs alongside inflation.'],['Employment','Look at jobs created, job security, wages, youth employment and informal work.'],['Public debt and taxes','Review debt service, revenue, tax burden, borrowing costs and transparency.'],['Service delivery','Compare budget allocations with completed projects, access, quality and audits.']].forEach(x=>{ %><div class="col-md-6"><div class="question-card"><h3><%= x[0] %></h3><p><%= x[1] %></p></div></div><% }) %></div><h2 class="mt-5 mb-3">Related reported developments</h2><% developments.forEach(d=>{ %><div class="timeline-item"><span class="date-label"><%= d.date %> · <%= d.area %></span><h3><%= d.title %></h3><p><%= d.summary %></p><a href="<%= d.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source ↗</a></div><% }) %><div class="notice mt-4">Use primary sources such as KNBS, Central Bank of Kenya, National Treasury, Controller of Budget and Auditor-General where possible. An announcement is not proof of completed delivery or impact.</div></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
